    "name": "Tupi: The Legend of Arariboia",
    "steam_appid": 3028370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/99e3dcab0c318d4c915dbe154a2ca5b9.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/99e3dcab0c318d4c915dbe154a2ca5b9.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tupi: The Legend of Arariboia is a turn-based roguelite role-playing game based on the story of the indigenous warrior Arariboia and the set of myths that make up South American native mythology as a whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/1e7a478172f8d96e8b1e9c892ed6ec3a.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=744 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/1e7a478172f8d96e8b1e9c892ed6ec3a.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/1e7a478172f8d96e8b1e9c892ed6ec3a.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Arariboia, will brave the dangers of the wilderness and visit natural wonders while enlisting creatures from fauna and mythology to fight for his cause and defeat the evil that has destroyed his village.<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/5b92fe86d8eca16b81a21d4f4474d99c.avif?t=1749470495\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a turn-based roguelite RPG that implements a system based on the classic and popular series of Japanese turn-based RPG games, Shin Megami Tensei, which allows you to recruit enemies as allies to make up your team and face increasingly difficult battles as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/17aeb4bb8324eb300bcd28257f035167.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=744 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/17aeb4bb8324eb300bcd28257f035167.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/17aeb4bb8324eb300bcd28257f035167.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/c476ac4919c92bdacb3bc8fe9be03299.avif?t=1749470495\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster Taming System: Inspired by Shin Megami Tensei, the player can capture creatures through gameplay and add them to their party to fight alongside the player character. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/1e727cd1afd674bad0e9b16c67815e33.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=744 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/1e727cd1afd674bad0e9b16c67815e33.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/1e727cd1afd674bad0e9b16c67815e33.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster Fusion System: The player will be able to fuse creatures to create a new one that inherits skills from the ones used to make them. Though employing a roguelike-oriented model, in this version the player is offered three options from which to pick rather than a single result.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/3eb796e7af95229a7fa4a9f4e2c2844b.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/3eb796e7af95229a7fa4a9f4e2c2844b.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/3eb796e7af95229a7fa4a9f4e2c2844b.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positional Turn-based Combat: Characters occupy specific positions on a 2x2 grid on their side of the combat area, with the player character occupying a position in the middle. They can move between them, switching positions with their allies. Skills both require the user and the target to be in specific positions to be used.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/46d5b9d711fffb8ee1e790cd7dcd071e.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=744 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/46d5b9d711fffb8ee1e790cd7dcd071e.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/46d5b9d711fffb8ee1e790cd7dcd071e.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run-based Roguelike Exploration with a Day/Night Cycle: The game will have three Areas to explore with maps semi randomized generated with connected different event nodes. As the player explores the map, time passes on every move to another node. During the Night, events and exploration become more difficult but the rewards improve accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/fc5a5bd5fe2ca6cd03487b3ffaa2f1db.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=744 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/fc5a5bd5fe2ca6cd03487b3ffaa2f1db.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/fc5a5bd5fe2ca6cd03487b3ffaa2f1db.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settlement Management: The player has a Hub with upgradable buildings that offer services attached to the meta-progression systems of the game giving the player upgrades and new skills for new runs. The most important buildings are also where the player can interact with characters they meet that join the settlement as the game and history progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/a43e193ec563979fb4c14a8af90a0e14.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=744 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/a43e193ec563979fb4c14a8af90a0e14.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/a43e193ec563979fb4c14a8af90a0e14.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/99e3dcab0c318d4c915dbe154a2ca5b9.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/99e3dcab0c318d4c915dbe154a2ca5b9.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tupi: The Legend of Arariboia is a turn-based roguelite role-playing game based on the story of the indigenous warrior Arariboia and the set of myths that make up South American native mythology as a whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/1e7a478172f8d96e8b1e9c892ed6ec3a.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=744 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/1e7a478172f8d96e8b1e9c892ed6ec3a.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/1e7a478172f8d96e8b1e9c892ed6ec3a.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Arariboia, will brave the dangers of the wilderness and visit natural wonders while enlisting creatures from fauna and mythology to fight for his cause and defeat the evil that has destroyed his village.<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/5b92fe86d8eca16b81a21d4f4474d99c.avif?t=1749470495\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a turn-based roguelite RPG that implements a system based on the classic and popular series of Japanese turn-based RPG games, Shin Megami Tensei, which allows you to recruit enemies as allies to make up your team and face increasingly difficult battles as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/17aeb4bb8324eb300bcd28257f035167.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=744 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/17aeb4bb8324eb300bcd28257f035167.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/17aeb4bb8324eb300bcd28257f035167.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/c476ac4919c92bdacb3bc8fe9be03299.avif?t=1749470495\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster Taming System: Inspired by Shin Megami Tensei, the player can capture creatures through gameplay and add them to their party to fight alongside the player character. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/1e727cd1afd674bad0e9b16c67815e33.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=744 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/1e727cd1afd674bad0e9b16c67815e33.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/1e727cd1afd674bad0e9b16c67815e33.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster Fusion System: The player will be able to fuse creatures to create a new one that inherits skills from the ones used to make them. Though employing a roguelike-oriented model, in this version the player is offered three options from which to pick rather than a single result.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/3eb796e7af95229a7fa4a9f4e2c2844b.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/3eb796e7af95229a7fa4a9f4e2c2844b.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/3eb796e7af95229a7fa4a9f4e2c2844b.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positional Turn-based Combat: Characters occupy specific positions on a 2x2 grid on their side of the combat area, with the player character occupying a position in the middle. They can move between them, switching positions with their allies. Skills both require the user and the target to be in specific positions to be used.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/46d5b9d711fffb8ee1e790cd7dcd071e.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=744 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/46d5b9d711fffb8ee1e790cd7dcd071e.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/46d5b9d711fffb8ee1e790cd7dcd071e.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run-based Roguelike Exploration with a Day/Night Cycle: The game will have three Areas to explore with maps semi randomized generated with connected different event nodes. As the player explores the map, time passes on every move to another node. During the Night, events and exploration become more difficult but the rewards improve accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/fc5a5bd5fe2ca6cd03487b3ffaa2f1db.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=744 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/fc5a5bd5fe2ca6cd03487b3ffaa2f1db.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/fc5a5bd5fe2ca6cd03487b3ffaa2f1db.mp4?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settlement Management: The player has a Hub with upgradable buildings that offer services attached to the meta-progression systems of the game giving the player upgrades and new skills for new runs. The most important buildings are also where the player can interact with characters they meet that join the settlement as the game and history progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/a43e193ec563979fb4c14a8af90a0e14.poster.avif?t=1749470495\" width=744 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/a43e193ec563979fb4c14a8af90a0e14.webm?t=1749470495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028370/extras/a43e193ec563979fb4c14a8af90a0e14.mp4?